<p id="breadcrumbs">	You are here:
<span><span><a href="https://gov.alaska.gov/">Home</a></span> / <span><a href="https://gov.alaska.gov/media/">Media</a></span> / <span class="breadcrumb_last" aria-current="page">Photos</span></span></p>
<div id="main-content">


	<div class="container">
		<div id="content-area" class="clearfix">
			<div id="left-area">


			
				<article id="post-10656" class="post-10656 page type-page status-publish hentry">

				
					<h1 class="entry-title main_title">Photos</h1>
				
				
					<div class="entry-content">
					<h4>Governor Signs House Bill 14 </h4>
<p>Governor Michael J. Dunleavy signs House Bill 14 in Juneau, HB 14 closes the &#8216;Schneider Loophole.&#8217;</p>
<p><a data-flickr-embed="true" href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/govdunleavy/albums/72157709752324331" title="07192019 - HB 14 Signing by GovDunleavy, on Flickr"><img decoding="async" src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48326283632_4cab4c9a72_b.jpg" width="100%" alt="GV1_1429"></a><script async src="https://embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<hr />
<h4>Governor Visits Shovel Creek Fire</h4>
<p>Governor Michael J. Dunleavy visits with wildland firefighters fighting the Shovel Creek Fire near Fairbanks. </p>
<p><a data-flickr-embed="true" href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/govdunleavy/albums/72157709751137087" title="Shovel Creek Fire Visit by GovDunleavy, on Flickr"><img decoding="async" src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48325746211_6670ac5c46_b.jpg" width="100%" alt="GV1_1235"></a><script async src="https://embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<hr />
<h4>Governor Visits Community of Igiugig </h4>
<p>Governor Michael J. Dunleavy visits the community of Igiugig in Southwest Alaska and observes the progress being made on the RivGen Power System in-river turbine. </p>
<p><a data-flickr-embed="true" href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/govdunleavy/albums/72157709691528826" title="07162019 - Igiugig Trip &amp; RIvGen Power System Event by GovDunleavy, on Flickr"><img decoding="async" src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48303172216_f7b05432a4_b.jpg" width="100%" alt="GV1_1052"></a><script async src="https://embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<hr />
<h4>Governor Attends Arctic Lightning Air Show</h4>
<p>Governor Michael J. Dunleavy attends the Arctic Lightning Air Show at Eielson Air Force Base near Fairbanks, Alaska. The F-35 Lightning II was demonstrated to the large crowd as preparations are underway at Eielson AFB to house two squadrons of the plane beginning next year. </p>
<p><a data-flickr-embed="true" href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/govdunleavy/albums/72157709691466227" title="07132019 - Arctic Lightning Air Show by GovDunleavy, on Flickr"><img decoding="async" src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48303358662_cbcf3fa8da_b.jpg" width="100%" alt="GV1_0597"></a><script async src="https://embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<hr />
<h4>Governor Speaks at Susitna Rotary</h4>
<p>Governor Michael J. Dunleavy speaks to members of the Susitna Rotary at a meeting in Wasilla. </p>
<p><a data-flickr-embed="true" href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/govdunleavy/albums/72157709580424582" title="07102019 - Susitna Rotary by GovDunleavy, on Flickr"><img decoding="async" src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48258764852_7d371132d8_b.jpg" width="100%" alt="GV1_0422"></a><script async src="https://embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<hr />
<h4>Governor Signs House Bill 49</h4>
<p>Governor Michael J. Dunleavy signs house bill 49 at the Alaska State Troopers Hangar in Anchorage. House Bill 49 is criminal justice legislation that effectively repeals the failed Senate Bill 91.</p>
<p><a title="07082019 - HB49 Bill Signing by GovDunleavy, on Flickr" href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/govdunleavy/albums/72157709521014807" data-flickr-embed="true"><img decoding="async" src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48235232471_fc98e4c778_b.jpg" alt="GV1_0099" width="100%" /></a><script async src="https://embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<hr />
<h4>Governor Signs Senate Bill 16/h4&gt;<br />
Governor Michael J. Dunleavy signs Senate Bill 16 in Anchorage. SB 16 changes alcohol statutes to allow certain special events, such as the Alaska State Fair, and venues, such as the Alaska Center for the Performing Arts, to sell alcohol.</h4>
<p><a title="07052019 - Senate Bill 16 Signing by GovDunleavy, on Flickr" href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/govdunleavy/albums/72157709451319562" data-flickr-embed="true"><img decoding="async" src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/48206897202_d66d3bdb65_b.jpg" alt="GV1_0082-Edit" width="100%" /></a><script async src="https://embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<hr />
<h4 id="swan-lake">Governor Visits Swan Lake Fire</h4>
<p>Governor Michael J. Dunleavy traveled to the Swan Lake Fire near Sterling, Alaska to thank firefighters and receive an update on the fire&#8217;s containment.</p>
