<h4>Governor Dunleavy Holds First Cabinet Meeting</h4>
<p>Governor Mike Dunleavy holds his first cabinet meeting in Anchorage.</p>
<p><a title="12032018 - Anchorage Cabinet Meeting by GovDunleavy, on Flickr" href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/160844104@N06/albums/72157676352904848" data-flickr-embed="true"><img decoding="async" src="https://farm5.staticflickr.com/4804/32306643318_ab449364e4_b.jpg" alt="12032018 - Cabinet1" width="100%" /></a><script async="" src="https://embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<hr />
<h4>Mat-Su Valley Inaugural Celebration</h4>
<p>Governor Mike Dunleavy, First Lady Rose Dunleavy, and Lt. Governor Kevin Meyer celebrate their inauguration at the Menard Sports Complex in Wasilla. More photos from this event can be found by <a href="https://www.ambienceak.net/Customer-Galleries/Products-Commercial-Photos/Governor-Inaugural-Ball/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">clicking here.</a></p>
<p><a title="12042018 - Mat-Su Inaugural Celebration by GovDunleavy, on Flickr" href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/govdunleavy/albums/72157704882317134" data-flickr-embed="true"><img decoding="async" src="https://farm5.staticflickr.com/4882/32539869828_5d8b395b53_b.jpg" alt="DSC_1044" width="100%" /></a><script async="" src="https://embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<hr />
<h4 id="swearing-in">Swearing In Ceremony</h4>
<p>Governor Mike Dunleavy and Lt. Governor Meyer take the oath of office in Kotzebue, Alaska.</p>
<p><a title="12032018 - Gov. Dunelavy Swearing In, Kotzebue by GovDunleavy, on Flickr" href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/160844104@N06/albums/72157701029410542" data-flickr-embed="true"><img decoding="async" src="https://farm5.staticflickr.com/4899/31229164807_0f7821daf0_b.jpg" alt="OPK-2" width="100%" /></a><script async="" src="https://embedr.flickr.com/assets/client-code.js" charset="utf-8"></script></p>
<hr />
					</div>

				
				</article>

			

